{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Vienna, 21st Sept.\n\nMy dearest Marie,\n\nI have reached Vienna safely, after a long, dusty journey of forty-two miles from Prague. We travelled in an express coach with a couple returning from Karlsbad and the Archduke’s physician. The hours were long, but the company kept the time passing.\n\nI took a room at the Erzherzog Karl and spent the evening at the Italian opera. It was a Mercadante piece, with Rubini, Donzelli, Lablache, and Eckerlin singing. I must confess, the music was quite charming, a welcome relief after the road.\n\nBefore bed, I found Lilli and Klein at the inn. We had a pleasant chat over wine. I miss you and the boys terribly. Please do not worry about me; I am well. I look forward to our reunion.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795221181,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":190,"prompt_tokens":251,"total_tokens":441,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-Dh79owOalpJkr0ZfvA1jRtdFvFP0LVEo","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":251,"prompt_ms":459.68,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.831394422310757,"prompt_per_second":546.0320222763662,"predicted_n":190,"predicted_ms":4433.928,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.459936507936508,"predicted_per_second":42.62586131303891}}